Quill Native is a new implementation in Swift and Kotlin. It contains no
source code, images or other files copied from Quill. Its Micropub property
conventions and feature list were researched from Quill at commit
3cabff0c599439864fe82f6d923c11c7a69aa58b. The original Quill icon is not
included.

"Quill" is used here only to credit the original project. The Apache License
grants no rights to Quill's name or marks.
